pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |-
  驾驶行为量化因子 Q：趋势反向化（P_r）→ 归一化（消除量纲）→ 加权求和得到 Q。
  图 12 表明 Q 越大、速度工况越高，驱动电机能耗均值越大。
elements:
  - elementId: chapter-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 960, 56]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
  - elementId: chapter-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 11, 760, 34]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 24
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: '02. 数据与方法 —— 驾驶行为量化因子'
  - elementId: chapter-brand
    elementType: text
    bounds: [736, 20, 176, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 8.8
      color: "$accent6"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: EV RANGE · 学术报告
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 70, 864, 34]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: Q = 趋势反向化 · 归一化 · 加权求和
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 104, 864, 16]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 9.6
      wrap: false
      text: 把 7 项指标压缩成一个连续数值，为每个短行驶片段标注驾驶行为
  - elementId: step-1-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 132, 320, 92]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [12000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
    shadow: { blur: 8, color: "#1F5FBF12", offset: [0, 2] }
  - elementId: step-1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 144, 32, 20]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: "01"
  - elementId: step-1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 144, 250, 18]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      fontSize: 11
      wrap: false
      text: 趋势反向化
  - elementId: step-1-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 168, 288, 48]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.2
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: P<sub>r</sub> 与能耗正相关、其余六项负相关，对 P<sub>r</sub> 取 i' = 1 − i 反向化，使各指标与能耗同向。
  - elementId: step-2-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 232, 320, 92]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [12000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
    shadow: { blur: 8, color: "#1F5FBF12", offset: [0, 2] }
  - elementId: step-2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 244, 32, 20]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: "02"
  - elementId: step-2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 244, 250, 18]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      fontSize: 11
      wrap: false
      text: 归一化处理
  - elementId: step-2-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 268, 288, 48]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.2
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: P<sub>a</sub>、P<sub>h</sub>、P<sub>r</sub> 本身为占比无需处理；仅对 V<sub>m</sub>、V<sub>std</sub>、a<sub>m</sub>、a<sub>std</sub> 归一化，消除量纲差异。
  - elementId: step-3-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 332, 320, 92]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [12000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primarySoft" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primaryTint" }
  - elementId: step-3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 344, 32, 20]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: "03"
  - elementId: step-3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 344, 250, 18]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      fontSize: 11
      wrap: false
      text: 加权求和
  - elementId: step-3-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 368, 288, 48]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.2
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: f(i) 为归一化后的评价指标，w<sub>i</sub> 为随机森林权重系数，n = 7。每个片段由此获得唯一连续标签。
  - elementId: formula-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 436, 320, 36]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [14000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primaryDeep" }
  - elementId: formula
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 440, 288, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |-
        <p>\(Q = \sum_{i=1}^{n} f(i) \cdot w_i\)</p>
  - elementId: fig-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [392, 132, 520, 300]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
    shadow: { blur: 12, color: "#1F5FBF14", offset: [0, 3] }
  - elementId: fig-12
    elementType: image
    bounds: [396, 136, 512, 262]
    src: media/fig12_consumption.jpg
    fit: { mode: contain }
  - elementId: fig-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [396, 402, 512, 26]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 8.2
      text: |-
        <p><span style="color:$accent;font-weight:bold;">图 12</span>　不同速度工况下驾驶行为量化因子与驱动电机能耗均值</p>
  - elementId: reading
    elementType: text
    bounds: [392, 438, 520, 34]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.4
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: 随 Q 增大，能耗均值上升；同一 Q 下速度工况越高、能耗越大——<strong>驾驶越激烈，剩余续驶里程越短</strong>。
  - elementId: footer-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 502, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 507, 640, 12]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      wrap: false
      text: 基于驾驶行为量化特征的电动汽车剩余续驶里程预测 · 《新能源车辆工程学报》
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [800, 506, 112, 14]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 8.5
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 08 / 15
